1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,811
From the same workspace, a business can open a share offering, and investors see the dilution before any new shares are issued.

2
00:00:06,811 --> 00:00:09,073
A dividend rule is approved once.

3
00:00:09,073 --> 00:00:14,192
After twenty-four hours to cancel, it is paid to every wallet, and holders pay no gas.

